<rml>
<head>
  <title>Fotbiler Football Credits</title>
  <link type="text/rcss" href="theme.rcss" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="screen">
    <div class="bg-deep"></div>
    <div class="bg-blue"></div>
    <div class="bg-pink"></div>

    <div class="shell">
      <div class="topbar">
        <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">F</span>OTBILER FOOTBALL</div>
        <div id="credits-profile" class="profile">CREDITS</div>
      </div>

      <div class="tabs">
        <div class="tab" tabindex="0" data-route="main-menu">HOME</div>
        <div id="credits-tab" class="tab active">CREDITS</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="primary-column">
          <div class="tile hero" tabindex="0" autofocus>
            <div class="hero-number">F</div>
            <div class="tile-kicker">OPEN FOOTBALL PROJECT</div>
            <div class="tile-title">FOTBILER FOOTBALL</div>
            <div class="tile-copy">Built on the Gameplay Football / League Soccer codebase and the blunt3d engine, carried forward as Fotbiler Football.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="row small-row">
            <div class="tile small first quick">
              <div class="tile-kicker">ORIGINAL PROJECT</div>
              <div class="tile-title">GAMEPLAY FOOTBALL</div>
              <div class="tile-copy">Programming, graphics, modelling and player animation work by Bastiaan Schuiling, with contributions and support credited by the original project.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="tile small league">
              <div class="tile-kicker">ENGINE</div>
              <div class="tile-title">BLUNT3D</div>
              <div class="tile-copy">Original engine architecture and programming by Bastiaan Schuiling, with the TaskSequence concept credited to Jurian Broertjes and Bastiaan Schuiling.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="secondary-column">
          <div class="tile news">
            <div class="tile-kicker">OPEN SOURCE FOUNDATIONS</div>
            <div class="tile-title">TOOLS &amp; LIBRARIES</div>
            <div class="tile-copy">The original credits acknowledge SDL, OpenGL, OpenAL, Boost, SQLite, libhungarian, Perlin noise work and other open-source projects and technical references.</div>
            <div class="news-stripe"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="row utility-row">
            <div class="tile utility" tabindex="0" data-route="main-menu">
              <div class="tile-kicker">NAVIGATION</div>
              <div id="credits-back-title" class="tile-title">BACK TO HOME</div>
              <div class="tile-copy">Return to the Fotbiler Football main menu.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
          <span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ENTER</span> Select</span>
          <span class="hint"><span class="hint-key">ESC</span> Back</span>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-right"><span class="version">M1B.1 · CREDITS</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</rml>
